# Workshop Registration Admin Portal
## Project Overview
Workshop Registration Admin Portal is a full-stack web application used to manage workshops, participants, attendance check-ins, announcements, dashboards, and reports.
The system provides role-based access where Admin, Staff, and Viewer users have different permissions.

# Features
## Authentication & Authorization
* JWT-based login authentication
* Password hashing using bcrypt
* Role-based access control

Roles:
* Admin
* Staff
* Viewer

## Workshop Management
* Create workshops
* Update workshop details
* Delete workshops
* View workshop list

## Participant Management
* Add participants
* Upload participants using CSV
* Duplicate participant checking
* Search and filter participants

## Attendance / Check-in
* Staff can mark participant attendance
* Track registration and attendance status

## Dashboard
* Total workshops count
* Total participants count
* Attendance statistics
* Live dashboard updates

## Announcements
* Create announcements
* Display announcements to users

## Reports
* Export participant reports
* CSV report generation

