# Installation Setup
## Backend Setup
Go to backend folder:
cd backend
Install dependencies:
npm install

Create `.env` file:
PORT=3001
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_USER=root
DB_PASSWORD=
DB_NAME=workshop_portal
JWT_SECRET=your_secret_key

Run backend:
npm run dev
Backend runs on:
http://localhost:3001

## Frontend Setup
Go to frontend folder:
cd frontend
Install dependencies:
npm install
Run frontend:
npm run dev
Frontend runs on:
http://localhost:5173

