# API Documentation
## Authentication APIs
### Register User
POST  /api/auth/register
Request:
    json
        {
        "name":"Admin",
        "email":"admin@gmail.com",
        "password":"123456",
        "role":"admin"
        }

### Login
POST  /api/auth/login
Request:
    json
        {
        "email":"admin@gmail.com",
        "password":"123456"
        }

Response:
    json
        {
        "success":true,
        "token":"JWT_TOKEN"
        }


# Workshop APIs
## Create Workshop
POST /api/workshops
Authorization:
Admin

## Get Workshops
GET /api/workshops

## Update Workshop
PUT  /api/workshops/:id

## Delete Workshop
DELETE /api/workshops/:id

---
# Participant APIs
## Add Participant
POST /api/participants

## Get Participants
GET /api/participants

## Upload CSV
POST  /api/participants/upload
Supported:
CSV file only
Validation:
* Duplicate email check
* Duplicate phone check

# Attendance APIs
## Check-in Participant
PUT /api/participants/checkin/:id

---
# Announcement APIs
## Create Announcement
POST /api/announcements
Admin only

## Get Announcements
GET /api/announcements

---
# Report APIs
## Export Participants Report
GET /api/reports/participants/export

Output: CSV File

